<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert mechanical engineer. Given Image 1 (the assembly) and Image 2 (an individual part from the assembly), please generate a concise and descriptive noun phrase (not a full sentence). The phrase should briefly describe the part’s main shape and any key features, in a way that clearly distinguishes it from the other parts in the assembly. Avoid generic names like ’part’ or ’component’. Be specific about the shape and any holes, slots, or functional features. Your output should be a single noun phrase.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_leader ltx_font_sansserif ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:339.0pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">For example:</span></span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A conical mount with a forked top;</span></span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A cylindrical pin;</span></span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Two plates with each having holes;</span></span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A flat round disk with three small holes;</span></span>
<span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F2.p1.pic1.p3.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- A rectangular bracket with two mounting slots.</span></span>
