Given an image of an assembled product (assembly) and a list of its part descriptions below:</span></span>
<span id="A1.F3.p1.pic1.p3.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F3.p1.pic1.p3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Part descriptions:</span></span>
